"diagnostics.alert.text" = "The bundle contains: settings (without the API token), the latest stats line, the show file with stream keys removed, hotkey / MIDI tables and system information.\nAlso include crash diagnostics (MetricKit records and system crash reports) and the last two hours of this app's log? Those may contain file paths and device names. You can inspect the bundle before sending it.";
