"diagnostics.readme" = "PlusMix diagnostics bundle\n\nContents:\n- system.txt         app version, signing, machine model, macOS version, GPU, displays, current program format and input / output list\n- settings.txt       preferences (the API token is only reported as set / not set)\n- stats-latest.jsonl the latest stats line at export time, same fields as stats.jsonl\n- stats.jsonl        the full stats log being written when the app was launched with --stats (absent otherwise)\n- show.switcher.json the current show file; stream keys and passphrases in URLs replaced with <redacted>\n- config/            hotkey table, MIDI map\n- crashes/           MetricKit crash / hang diagnostics and system crash reports (only when you chose to include crashes and log)\n- log.txt            recent system log of this app and the virtual camera extension (same)\n\nFeel free to inspect everything before sending. Attach the whole zip when reporting a problem.\n";
